{
  "id": "objeto-heroi-2",
  "territory": "objeto-heroi",
  "meta": {
    "tone": "light",
    "needsImage": true,
    "imageSlot": "Um único objeto simbólico fotografado com luz dramática de estúdio (luz lateral, sombra longa, reflexo). O objeto está posicionado no canto inferior direito, deixando a metade superior e a lateral esquerda da imagem completamente vazias. O fundo da foto deve ser de uma cor sólida e lisa.",
    "slots": {
      "headline": {
        "max": 25
      },
      "support": {
        "max": 90
      }
    },
    "summary": "Objeto hero no canto inferior direito com título monumental no topo esquerdo protegido por um forte degradê da cor da marca."
  },
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #F4F0EB;\n      --ink: #1A1A1A;\n      --accent: #E63946;\n      --muted: #8D8D8D;\n      --display: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n      --body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 1350px;\n      margin: 0;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: var(--bg);\n      font-family: var(--body);\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    .hero-image {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 1350px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .gradient-overlay {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 1080px;\n      height: 900px;\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        var(--bg) 35%,\n        color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 85%, transparent) 60%,\n        transparent 100%\n      );\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .gradient-left {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 500px;\n      height: 1350px;\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        to right,\n        var(--bg) 20%,\n        color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 70%, transparent) 60%,\n        transparent 100%\n      );\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .headline-container {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 120px;\n      left: 80px;\n      width: 920px;\n      height: 400px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      z-index: 3;\n    }\n\n    .headline-container h1 {\n      font-family: var(--display);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 80px;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      line-height: 1.05;\n      letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    }\n\n    .accent-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 540px;\n      left: 80px;\n      width: 140px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background-color: var(--accent);\n      z-index: 3;\n    }\n\n    .support-container {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 580px;\n      left: 80px;\n      width: 600px;\n      height: 300px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      z-index: 3;\n    }\n\n    .support-container p {\n      font-family: var(--body);\n      font-weight: 400;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      font-size: 36px;\n    }\n\n    .logo-container {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 80px;\n      left: 80px;\n      width: 300px;\n      height: 80px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      z-index: 3;\n    }\n\n    .logo-container img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n      max-height: 80px;\n      object-fit: contain;\n    }\n\n    .handle-container {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 80px;\n      right: 80px;\n      width: 300px;\n      height: 40px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      z-index: 3;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    .handle-container p {\n      font-family: var(--body);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-size: 28px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <img class=\"hero-image\" src=\"{{asset:hero}}\" alt=\"Hero Object\">\n  <div class=\"gradient-overlay\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gradient-left\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"handle-container\">\n    <p data-fit=\"handle\">{{handle}}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"headline-container\">\n    <h1 data-fit=\"headline\">{{slot:headline}}</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"accent-line\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"support-container\">\n    <p data-fit=\"support\">{{slot:support}}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"logo-container\">\n    <img src=\"{{logo:on-light}}\" alt=\"Logo\">\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
}
